Description: Climate data of Mexico from the NASA POWER API (daily,
    monthly or climatological temperature, precipitation, humidity, wind and
    radiation) for the 2,465 municipalities of Mexico or any set of points.
    One request per point with all the period, up to five at a time, with
    retries; the download can be stopped and resumed, and the result has
    one row per point and date.
